'''Alakazam''' (Japanese: '''フーディン''' ''Foodin'') is a {{ct|Psychic}} Stage 2 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Genetic Apex}} expansion.

