==Trivia==
The illustration rare print of this card portrays the same scene as the special illustration rare print of {{TCG ID|Genetic Apex|Machamp ex|278}} from the same set, but from a different angle.

===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Mysterious Treasures|Alakazam|2}} from the {{TCG|Mysterious Treasures}} expansion.
*{{m|Psychic}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Alakazam}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

